commit d5db51ae232cab8957488dd88da8c2f2064accec
Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 2 03:09:47 2026 +0900

    refactor(14-01): migrate db.ts, binance.ts, klines.ts time conversions to TemporalConverter
    
    - db.ts: Timestamp.now().toSeconds() → TemporalConverter.dateToSec(new Date())
      (all three sites produce second-domain values; no ms conversion)
    - binance.ts: Timestamp.fromMillis(raw[0]).toSeconds() → TemporalConverter.msToSec(raw[0])
    - klines.ts: Timestamp.fromMillis(ms).toSeconds() → TemporalConverter.msToSec(ms)
    - validate.ts + all service files audited: zero time conversions (no-op)
    - Removed now-unused Timestamp imports from the three migrated modules
    - Negative assertion: zero Math.floor(ms/1000)/Timestamp.fromMillis outside temporal-api + timestamp

